      "statement": "ModelFallbackMiddleware wraps the model call in a retry loop that alternates between the primary and a cross-provider fallback model on transient errors, using an exponential backoff schedule with jitter, retrying on 5xx/429-class statuses, connection/timeout errors, and the TimeoutError from ModelCallTimeoutMiddleware.",
